<title>USA: Washington Township, N.J., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Washington Township, N.J., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities, Inc said</p>
<p>it won $7.134 million of Washington Township, N.J., general</p>
<p>obligation bonds, 1996, with the lowest rate of 5.30, highest price</p>
<p>of 100.154.</p>
</text>
